OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man pulled from river
OL,4,A'not suspicious'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a man whose body was
OL,7,Frecovered from a river in Northampton
OL,8,Fis not being treated as suspicious.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police was called to
OL,11,Fthe Nene, off St James' Mill Road, at
OL,12,Fabout 09:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FA spokeswoman said a post-mortem
OL,15,Fexamination on Thursday at Leicester
OL,16,FRoyal Infirmary had found "no
OL,17,Findication to suggest there are any
OL,18,Fsuspicious circumstances".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
