OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man pulled from river
OL,4,A'not suspicious'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our investigation will continue,
OL,7,Fhowever, to establish the circumstances
OL,8,Fwhich led to him coming to be in the
OL,9,Fwater, and our thoughts remain with his
OL,10,Floved ones at this time," she added.
